  "chapter": "RENEWABILITY_AND_YOU",
  "description": "You may be wondering how to obtain §6large quantities§r of common resources used in §bGregTech§r. This might be old news to seasoned players, but it's actually possible to set up §dpassive processes§r to make various materials and chemicals §2fully renewable§r.

We've added this chapter to lead you towards some setups that you §7§omight§r desire. Obviously, there's no need to do all of these, but who doesn't love §2\"free\" resources§r.

